		(property "Description" "CONN HEADER 2x10 2.00mm vertical THT, Harwin Datamate J-Tek M80-5002042 with M2 internal-thread jackscrews, gold, 3.3A per contact, 800V working, 25mOhm max, 500 mating cycles, -55 to +125C, 100G shock, low outgassing - cell tap input option 3 (Harwin Datamate); taps are interleaved so orthogonally adjacent contacts stay within 2 cells (8.4V): pin 1 = VC0/GND, pins 2-8 = cell2/4/6/8/10/12/14, pin 9 = +BATT/VC16, pins 11-18 = cell1/3/5/7/9/11/13/15, pins 10/19/20 unused"
