		(property "Assembly condition" "EVERY CELL TAP CONNECTED EXACTLY ONCE - J401 / J402 / J403 ARE PARALLEL INPUTS ON VC0-VC16. FIT ONE CONNECTOR CARRYING ALL 17 TAPS, OR SPLIT THE TAPS ACROSS J402 AND J403 WITH NO TAP WIRED TO BOTH (see docs CMU-008 3.3). WIRING A TAP TWICE PARALLELS ITS FUSES AND HALVES ITS PROTECTION"
